                            <text>- AF FRANGI et al., "Multiscale Vessel Enhancement Filtering", Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention - MICCAI'98 Lecture Notes in Computer Science, (19980000), vol. 1496, doi:10.1007/BFb0056195, page 130, XP002345875</text>
